WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:04.600
MUN in the 21st century. Debate management for Model United Nations.

00:05.500 --> 00:10.200
Speakers list: every speech on time. Speakers list and Points of Information side by side, driven by keyboard shortcuts.

00:10.300 --> 00:13.200
…and live on the projector.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.600
Voting: votes counted in seconds. Count a show of hands, or let every delegate vote on their own device.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.600
Resolution editing: from working paper to adopted resolution. Write together, sponsor, amend and vote clause by clause.

00:31.500 --> 00:37.100
Help on every page: the manual is one click away. Every screen links to its own manual page and a guided tour.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.600
No account. No server. Try CHASE right now, entirely in your browser, or install the desktop app for macOS, Windows and Linux.

00:43.400 --> 00:45.700
Free. Open source. Self-hostable.

00:46.100 --> 00:49.000
MUNify CHASE. chase.munify.cloud. Documentation for every page at chase.munify.cloud/docs.
